# Building

For a source package, expose `packaging/debian` as the top-level `debian`
directory (for example from a release tarball prepared by CI), then run
`dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc`. Since this is a non-native `3.0 (quilt)` package,
place the matching pristine release source at
`../oblinux-branding_1.0.2.orig.tar.gz` when building a source package.
`librsvg2-bin` provides deterministic SVG rendering.
